 V_{n+1} - dim V_n ≥ 0` (embedding is injective into a\npossibly larger space). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HnInductiveEmbedding.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HnInductiveEmbedding.mk","kind":"ctor","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/markov-trace-operator-construction.lean#L51-L51","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HnInductiveEmbedding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HnInductiveEmbedding","kind":"class","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/markov-trace-operator-construction.lean#L50-L58","doc":"**Inductive-limit embedding** $V_n \\to V_{n+1}$ axiomatised. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HnHilbertRep.dim_Vn_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HnHilbertRep.dim_Vn_pos","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/markov-trace-operator-construction.lean#L41-L41","doc":"The dimension is positive (`dim V_n ≥ 1`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HnHilbertRep.dim_Vn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HnHilbertRep.dim_Vn","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/markov-trace-operator-construction.lean#L39-L39","doc":"Dimension of the per-$n$ representation space `V_n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HnHilbertRep.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HnHilbertRep.mk","kind":"ctor","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism